@startuml
title UC-03＋UC-04 出场设计通信图（AI-辅助）
object "车主界面" as ui
object ":AccessController" as controller
object ":AccessService" as access
object ":AccessRepository" as repo
object ":PassClient" as pass
object ":SpaceClient" as space
object ":BillingClient" as billing
ui --> controller : 1 requestExit()\n2 completeExit()
controller --> access : 1.1 requestExit()\n2.1 completeExit()
access --> repo : 1.2 byId/exitIntent\n1.5 reserveExit\n1.7 exitRequested\n2.5 paid\n2.8 closed
access --> pass : 1.3 eligibility [首次]\n2.3 deduct [月卡]\n2.6 refundRemainder [预约]
access --> space : 1.4 settle\n2.7 release [已付]
access --> billing : 1.6 createBill\n2.2 bill\n2.4 pay [未付]
note bottom
  消息编号表达执行顺序；方括号是条件，不表示每次均调用。
  billing 失败时保留 1.5 的出场意图；2.7 失败时保留已付待释放状态。
end note
@enduml
